      ],
      "source": "https://getindiana.com/news/bloomfield",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Bloomfield High School’s girls basketball team won the 1A state title in 1998, led by youngest state‑title coach Paula Fettig.",
